title: Remove deprecated GetStorageVersion::current_storage_version
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    # Description

    Removes deprecated `GetStorageVersion::current_storage_version` as part of #11561.

    The method was renamed to `in_code_storage_version` in March 2024. It has no remaining usage in this repository.

    Does not close #11561.

    ## Integration

    Rename calls before upgrading `frame-support`:

    ```diff
    - Pallet::<T>::current_storage_version()
    + Pallet::<T>::in_code_storage_version()
    ```
    Review Notes

    - Single-file change: substrate/frame/support/src/traits/metadata.rs
    - Verified no in-repo references to current_storage_version before removal
    - Default impl only forwarded to in_code_storage_version
crates:
- name: frame-support
  bump: major
